<article class="lesson">
  <h1>📚 Obsidian PKM — Shaxsiy Bilim Bazasi</h1>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Nima uchun Obsidian kerak?</h2>
    <p>
      Siz har kuni 50+ xabar, maqola, video ko'rasiz. Ularning 80%ini unutasiz.
      Obsidian — bu <strong>shaxsiy miyangizning tashqi xotirasi</strong>.
      Hamma narsa bitta joyda, qidirish oson, hech kim o'chirib yubormaydi.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. O'rgansa qanday foyda?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>🧠 <strong>Bilim yo'qolmaydi:</strong> barcha g'oyalar saqlanadi</li>
      <li>🔗 <strong>Bog'lanish:</strong> note'lar bir-biriga ulanadi (graph view)</li>
      <li>⚡ <strong>Tez qidirish:</strong> 1 soniyada kerakli ma'lumot</li>
      <li>📝 <strong>Yozish:</strong> maqola, insho, loyiha — hamma shu yerda</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Qayerda qo'llash?</h2>
    <div class="use-cases">
      <div><strong>📚 O'qish:</strong> IELTS, Admissions, materiallar</div>
      <div><strong>💼 Ish:</strong> loyiha, meeting notes, ideas</div>
      <div><strong>🎓 Tadqiqot:</strong> maqolalar, citation'lar</div>
      <div><strong>💡 G'oyalar:</strong> biznes, kontent, daromad g'oyalari</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Strawberryboo bilan avtomatik capture</h2>
    <p>
      Telefonda Telegram'dan xabar forward qilsangiz — Strawberryboo uni
      AI bilan xulosalab, Obsidian Inbox'ingizga tayyor note qilib saqlaydi.
      <strong>2 soniya ish, 100% saqlangan.</strong>
    </p>
    <pre><code>Telegram xabar → Strawberryboo → AI summary → Obsidian note</code></pre>
  </section>

  <p class="price">💎 Kurs narxi: <strong>$19</strong> (bir martalik to'lov)</p>
